A machine part's three views are shown in the figure. The top view is a semicircle inscribed in a square with a side length of 2. What is the volume of this machine part?
A. 8 + \frac{\pi}{3}
B. 8 + \frac{2\pi}{3}
C. 8 + \frac{8\pi}{3}
D. 8 + \frac{16\pi}{3}

As shown in the figure, if the rectangular paper is folded along the dashed line ① and then cut along the dashed line ② to create a right triangle, when unfolded, it forms an isosceles triangle. What is the perimeter of the triangle after unfolding? ( )
A. 2 + \sqrt{10}
B. 2 + 2\sqrt{10}
C. 12
D. 18
